      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORAINE CASMA (2) finds it hard to break through. Finished in the money last time though when third (22.78) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. EIGHT MATES (1) was out of the placings last time when eighth at Healesville (17.40) but scored four back at Traralgon (20.22). Has a good winning strike rate at this journey. Better than last start and can bounce back. ASTON BOGART (3) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when eighth at The Meadows over 525m behind Galleywood (31.24) in a Mix 6/7. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. TINKER SPOT (6) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
